OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 11 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: New Zealand
OL,5,     FComposers
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod explores five
OL,7,     Gclassical composers from the land
OL,8,     Gof the long white cloud, New
OL,9,     GZealand, focusing today on the
OL,10,     Glife and music of Dame Gillian
OL,11,     GWhitehead.
OL,12,G1700FIn Tune
OL,13,     GMax Bailie, Alasdair Beatson and
OL,14,     GMischa Maisky perform live in
OL,15,     Gstudio. Also, Petroc talks to
OL,16,     GNicola Benedetti about the
OL,17,     Gupcoming Edinburgh International
OL,18,     GFestival.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
